  line:
  - The round is over
  - Now my least favourite part- discarding
  - My Rat friend likes destroying art, he is evil
  - From your cards that lost during the battle he will choose the one he likes the
    least
  - and he'll destroy it, cut it in many pieces with his huge scissors
  - He likes scissoring
